    {
      "name": "mp-webhook (simulado)",
      "description": "Simula notificaciones de Mercado Pago firmadas con x-signature (HMAC-SHA256 del manifest `id:<data.id>;request-id:<x-request-id>;ts:<ts>;`). El webhook consulta el pago a la API de MP: con un payment_id real del sandbox el pedido pasa a \"received\"; con uno inexistente responde 404/502. Para la prueba determinística usá MP_API_BASE (sandbox) apuntando a un stub.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Firma válida, tópico distinto de payment → 200 ignorado",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const ts = Math.floor(Date.now() / 1000)",
                  "const requestId = 'postman-' + ts",
                  "const dataId = '123456'",
                  "const manifest = `id:${dataId};request-id:${requestId};ts:${ts};`",
                  "const sig = CryptoJS.HmacSHA256(manifest, pm.environment.get('mp_webhook_secret') || '').toString(CryptoJS.enc.Hex)",
                  "pm.variables.set('mp_signature', `ts=${ts},v1=${sig}`)",
                  "pm.variables.set('mp_request_id', requestId)"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200))",
                  "pm.test('ignorado', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().ignored).to.eql(true))"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "x-signature",
                "value": "{{mp_signature}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "x-request-id",
                "value": "{{mp_request_id}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/mp-webhook?data.id=123456&type=merchant_order",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["mp-webhook"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "data.id",
                  "value": "123456"
                },
                {
                  "key": "type",
                  "value": "merchant_order"
                }
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"type\":\"merchant_order\",\"data\":{\"id\":\"123456\"}}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
